# Workers Static Assets response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
# HSTS is the zone's. No CSP: Starlight inlines scripts that change with every upgrade.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
